abstract: >-
  Reproducible benchmark of low-cost NHANES predictors for current
  periodontitis classification. The primary calibrated ensemble uses 29
  predictors after excluding treatment-seeking variables and is evaluated with
  same-source temporal validation on NHANES 2009-2010.
